type behaviour
version 1
---
# A shooting plant's mind (og.ai): when it is set, reloaded and sees a
# visitor (og.Perception: the nearest within its range), it raises the
# game's `fire` command with its own handle. Damage, frost and the shot are
# the game's (src/systems.ts `fire`); the reload is the plant's Bed.cool.
name "plant"
tree {
  sequence shoot {
    check Bed.planted
    check Bed.cool atMost 0
    check sees
    command fire
  }
}
